2026-10-13T11:23:35.7691019Z options:
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7691166Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7691359Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7691564Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7691750Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7692272Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7692547Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7692858Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7693163Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7693459Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7693719Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7694018Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7694312Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7694710Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7694974Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7695284Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7695499Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7695710Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7695914Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7696111Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7696314Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7696491Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7696684Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7696918Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7697147Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7697343Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7697546Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7697739Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7697884Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698060Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698250Z                         block_size).
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698405Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698580Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698799Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7698982Z                         layers).
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7699125Z   --block-size BLOCK_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7699295Z                         vLLM paged block size in tokens; used to derive
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7699489Z                         block_number from input-len.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7699704Z   --kv-dtype KV_DTYPE   override KV dtype: bfloat16/bf16, float16/fp16,
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7700033Z                         float32/fp32, float8_e4m3fn/fp8, float8_e5m2, int8.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7700240Z                         Default: config torch_dtype or bfloat16.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7700460Z   --posix-data-trans-concurrency POSIX_DATA_TRANS_CONCURRENCY
