2026-10-13T11:23:35.7701033Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7701203Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7701382Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T11:23:35.7701565Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
